<p>Aake zainab ne di sada bhai<br />
Mera sab ghar ujad gaya bhai</p>

<p>Uth'ke dekho to qabre at'har se <br />
Mera kya haal ho gaya bhai</p>

<p>Pusht zaqmi kamar qameedah hai <br />
taik ke chalti hu'n asaa bhai</p>

<p>lad khadaati hu'n chal nahi sakti<br />
Uth ke do mujh ko aasra bhai</p>

<p>Ek sajjade naatawaa'n ke siwa <br />
koi baaqi nahi bacha bhai</p>

<p>Khoke aayi hu'n mai sakina ko<br />
jaa'n gaza hai ye waaqeya bhai</p>

<p>Arbaee'n dhoom se manaane ka <br />
Dil me armaan reh gaya bhai</p>

<p>Ahle yasrab ka kis tarah bolo <br />
Kar sakoongi mai saamna bhai</p>

<p>jaa rahi hu'n watan khuda haafiz<br />
Muntazar hongi fatima bhai</p>

<p>Maa ku turbat pa jaake ro'ungi<br />
Rone se jee nahi bhara bhai</p>

<p>Pooche tumko jo fatima soughra<br />
Us ko bolo kahu'n mai kya bhai</p>